{"id":"659996","name":"桑叶天罗妇","author":"铃兰蝴蝶","authorId":"6622556","desc":"","cover":"images/659996/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"桑叶尖","amount":"路边采的"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"桑叶采回来一定要多洗几遍，我用了贝壳粉，脏倒是不脏，就是虫子多，虫子多代表了没有打药。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/16/2024071617210700059703866622556.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"清洗干净的桑叶。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/16/2024071617210700458693396622556.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"用的笨鸡蛋，三个。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/16/2024071617210700470912246622556.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"面粉。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/16/2024071617210700481118056622556.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"加水搅拌后，液体鸡蛋偏多，水少一些，能挂住就行，不能太厚，太厚容易回软，加盐，十三香，花椒粉，味精。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/16/2024071617210700492953496622556.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中倒油，大火加热换小火炸。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/16/2024071617210700504685246622556.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"下至两面焦黄出锅，如果炸金黄，吃不完可以冷冻取出后复炸也好吃。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/16/2024071617210700520103436622556.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"特别嫩的一定要带点梗。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/16/2024071617210700533508826622556.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":9,"desc":"比外面的卖的气泡少是因为鸡蛋多，面粉少。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/16/2024071617210700546764296622556.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":10,"desc":"配上烧烤料很好吃！但不宜多吃，容易撑着！","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/16/2024071617210700559573486622556.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":11,"desc":"因为第一次做，没节制住。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/16/2024071617210700573315586622556.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}